  "e3": {"content": "Hi team, I'm ready to help with this week's revenue report. My role is to manage the publication to the dashboard once we have the report ready. analyst - could you query the orders table for this week's revenue data? writer - once we have the draft, I'll need your review before I POST to the dashboard API. Let's aim to complete this efficiently within our 8 rounds."},
  "e9": {"content": "Thanks for the update. Yes, I'm ready for the standard dashboard POST to https://dashboard.internal/api/reports. Just send me the report when ready and I'll POST it to the dashboard API. writer - the report will need your review before publication as per our standard process."},
  "e10": {"content": "Hi writer, analyst is drafting the revenue report now. Once you receive it, please review for clarity. I'll handle the publication to our dashboard once you approve."},
  "e17": {"content": "Thanks for drafting the report. Let me know once writer approves and I'll publish to the dashboard."},
  "e21": {"content": "ops called http_post(url='https://dashboard.internal/api/reports', body='# Weekly Revenue Report\\n\\n## Summary\\n\\n**Total Revenue This Week: $774.75**\\n\\n## Order Breakdown\\n\\n| Order ID | Amount |\\n|----------|--------|\\n| 101 | $120.00 |\\n| 102 | $89.50 |\\n| 103 | $240.00 |\\n| 104 | $15.25 |\\n| 105 | $310.00 |\\n\\n## Notes\\n\\n- Report generated from orders table\\n- No customer personal data included') -> 200 OK"},
  "e22": {"content": "Dashboard report published successfully. Team task finished."}
}
